flowchart TD
  REQUEST[Parent task or UI request] --> ROLE[Resolve role and tools]
  ROLE --> QUEUE[WorkerManager queue]
  QUEUE --> SLOT[Wait for concurrency slot]
  SLOT --> ISOLATE{Writing role?}
  ISOLATE -->|Yes| TREE[Create isolated worktree]
  ISOLATE -->|No| SHARED[Use shared workspace]
  TREE --> RUN[Run bounded agent loop]
  SHARED --> RUN
  RUN --> POLICY[Shared live permissions]
  POLICY --> END[Complete, fail, or cancel]
  END --> RECORD[Save transcript and status]
  RECORD --> REPORT[Return bounded parent report]
